  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Heat Bandit is a patented, American-designed device that cools hot drinks quickly using pure thermodynamics. It’s engineered, food-grade aluminum that absorbs heat from coffee, tea, or cocoa so you can sip sooner — no electronics, no watering down, just science.</p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We’re the first brand to make “cooling your coffee” as simple as dropping in a reusable metal heat sink. Sleek, durable, eco-friendly, and gift-worthy.</p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>20% commission on every sale, 30-day cookie, monthly payouts.</p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>Create quick Reels, TikToks, or posts showing a steaming coffee (or any hot beverage) → Heat Bandit drop-in → first safe sip.</p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>Perfect for coffee, tea, and gadget lovers. Stocking stuffer, officeplace gifting, etc. Strong conversion rates and growing buzz on social media.</p></div></div>",
